# ui/ conventions

- Keep widgets reusable and **decoupled from `app` singletons** (no `app.signals` / `app.settings` / `app.metadata` dependencies here).
- Import Qt via `qtpy` (`QtWidgets`, `QtCore`, `QtGui`, `Signal`, `Slot`).
- Prefer abstract bases in `ui/widgets/` (`AbstractPage`, `AbstractPane`, etc.) when adding page/pane-shaped widgets.
- Emit signals for state changes rather than reaching into application orchestration.
- Application-specific wiring belongs in `activity_browser/app/`, not here.
